-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- EX Saber Throw (2) ^3[CS1]
-- Thunderous Strikes (Knockdown/Force Focus) On Hit
-- Very Low Damage Saber Strikes (80Y/60B)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump (2)
- Push (2)
- Pull (2)
- Sense (3)
- Master Electric Judgment (Lightning 2) ^3[CS4]
-- Cripples, Stuns, Tracks
- Incinerate (Deadly Sight 1) ^3[CS2]
- Force Blast (Destruction 1)
- Repulse 
- Sever Force (Drain 2)

^8Attributes:
- Dexterity (1)
- Healing (1)
- Anti Mind Trick (2)
- 50% Faster Hack Speed
